From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:37:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Implement ProcessCommandLineInformation.

The server reads the command line from the parameters the process's PEB
points to, where the process may have changed it, or before the process
has started, from what its creator gave; querying it needs only
PROCESS_QUERY_LIMITED_INFORMATION, as on Windows.  The result is laid
out as ProcessImageFileName's is.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

